"Expectation remains possible, but the student describes the northbound echo "
"after the strike."
msgstr ""
"Expectation remains possible, but the student describes the northbound echo "
"after the strike."

#. incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.1.aya.1
#: src/data/incidents.js:38
msgctxt "text:incidentCases.late-bell-seven.testimony.1.aya.1"
